            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Sotto 0.1.2

- Setup needs two permissions now, Microphone and Accessibility, both with real macOS prompts. Input Monitoring is no longer required; it appears only as a fallback if Accessibility is declined.
- Cleanup no longer adds words after what you said.
- Usage descriptions and app category added. Release builds no longer carry the debug entitlement.
]]></description>
